WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.020 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 27]

01:45.240 --> 01:45.890
Elder Han.

01:48.880 --> 01:50.060
To Li Huayuan of Yellow Maple Valley.

01:54.760 --> 01:55.300
Halt.

01:57.920 --> 01:58.370
Elder Han.

01:58.800 --> 02:00.010
Where are you going?

02:01.160 --> 02:03.010
I received a missive addressed to Mentor Li

02:03.600 --> 02:04.420
from a cultivator in Yellow Maple Valley.

02:04.960 --> 02:05.530
I'm on my way to deliver it.

02:06.440 --> 02:06.940
Imbecile!

02:07.280 --> 02:08.500
You're abandoning your post.

02:08.920 --> 02:10.450
If the demonic sects invade now,

02:10.520 --> 02:11.580
they'll have an open door.

02:12.280 --> 02:13.580
Can no one else do it?

02:14.240 --> 02:14.900
Elder Han,

02:15.710 --> 02:16.980
everyone else is preparing for the battle.

02:17.750 --> 02:18.900
No one is available.

02:19.250 --> 02:20.090
Ridiculous.

02:20.890 --> 02:21.690
Forget it.

02:22.670 --> 02:24.260
I need to see Huayuan

02:24.280 --> 02:24.980
to discuss something anyway.

02:26.000 --> 02:26.690
Give me the missive.

02:26.920 --> 02:27.580
I'll pass it to him.

02:28.350 --> 02:28.940
I...

02:30.280 --> 02:30.770
Elder Han,

02:31.840 --> 02:33.900
this is addressed to Mentor Li of Yellow Maple Valley.

02:34.640 --> 02:35.180
I fear

02:35.600 --> 02:36.010
this is not right.

02:36.790 --> 02:37.540
Are disciples

02:37.670 --> 02:38.730
of the Clear Void Sect

02:38.750 --> 02:40.380
as impertinent as you are?

02:41.040 --> 02:43.100
Should I escalate this to Fu Yunzi?

02:43.430 --> 02:44.100
Please don't.

02:44.840 --> 02:45.570
Forgive me.

02:46.070 --> 02:46.570
I appreciate

02:47.680 --> 02:48.460
your help, Elder Han.

02:54.950 --> 02:55.900
Everyone

02:55.950 --> 02:56.850
has a job to complete.

02:57.560 --> 02:58.660
If there is a lack of manpower,

02:59.120 --> 03:00.820
I can ask Spirit Beast Mountain

03:01.280 --> 03:03.180
to handle the internal communication.

03:03.840 --> 03:04.740
Don't worry about it.

03:05.350 --> 03:05.690
Go now.

03:05.920 --> 03:06.290
Yes.

03:16.760 --> 03:18.210
He sure is cautious.

03:41.150 --> 03:42.020
Congratulations, Grandmaster.

03:42.640 --> 03:44.170
Spirit Beast Mountain sent news

03:45.000 --> 03:47.060
about when the Seven Sects are going to attack.

03:47.680 --> 03:48.980
They plan to siege us

03:49.430 --> 03:50.780
when we least expect it.

03:53.960 --> 03:56.290
We have let them live for long enough.

03:57.280 --> 03:58.290
Now is the time

03:59.000 --> 04:00.890
to see who is the victor.

04:02.960 --> 04:03.610
Wise choice,

04:04.910 --> 04:05.660
Grandmaster.

04:08.960 --> 04:09.540
Master,

04:09.710 --> 04:10.730
I'm done packing.

04:10.840 --> 04:11.940
We should go now.

04:13.430 --> 04:14.130
Sure.

04:17.120 --> 04:17.940
Xiao Cui'er!

04:21.240 --> 04:21.780
Han Li,

04:21.910 --> 04:22.540
you're back.

04:23.560 --> 04:24.730
Don't be rude.

04:25.150 --> 04:27.170
He's Mentor Han now.

04:27.840 --> 04:29.010
It was a force of habit.

04:30.680 --> 04:31.220
Mentor Han.

04:33.360 --> 04:33.890
You're taller now.

04:36.710 --> 04:37.010
Here.

04:37.400 --> 04:37.820
Take this.

04:41.030 --> 04:41.540
This

04:41.800 --> 04:42.610
is a pill

04:42.750 --> 04:43.820
to strengthen your base in the Qi Refining Stage.

04:44.560 --> 04:45.220
Consider it

04:45.360 --> 04:46.100
a gift for you.

04:47.680 --> 04:48.660
Thank you, Mentor Han.

04:49.080 --> 04:49.780
I

04:50.000 --> 04:50.820
won't let you down.

04:58.750 --> 04:59.780
All you do

04:59.910 --> 05:01.410
is talk to the girl.

05:01.710 --> 05:02.890
You never come to visit me.

05:11.360 --> 05:11.940
Mentor Ma.

05:15.150 --> 05:16.130
Who is that?

05:18.910 --> 05:20.010
You, Mentor Ma.

05:20.910 --> 05:22.850
Who is Mentor Ma?

05:23.030 --> 05:24.380
Senior Ma.

05:24.560 --> 05:25.170
Mentor Ma.

05:26.560 --> 05:27.100
I'll do as you say.

05:27.280 --> 05:27.820
All right?

05:30.910 --> 05:31.540
It's been a while.

05:33.240 --> 05:34.340
You brat.

05:34.570 --> 05:35.610
I see you still know your way here,

05:36.080 --> 05:37.610
and still remember me.

05:37.800 --> 05:38.610
Stop teasing me.

05:39.240 --> 05:40.170
When I first came here,

05:40.360 --> 05:41.410
you took me in

05:41.630 --> 05:42.450
and gave me pills.

05:42.960 --> 05:43.340
I'm forever

05:43.710 --> 05:44.570
grateful for that.

05:46.280 --> 05:46.610
Good.

05:47.080 --> 05:47.570
Come.

05:49.520 --> 05:50.450
All right.

05:52.950 --> 05:53.980
Go inside

05:54.310 --> 05:55.410
and pack everything.

05:55.720 --> 05:57.020
I need to speak

05:57.120 --> 05:57.980
with him.

05:58.600 --> 05:58.930
Yes.

06:03.270 --> 06:04.610
You brat.

06:05.270 --> 06:07.370
Don't hit on my disciple now.

06:08.430 --> 06:10.290
It seems like you quite like the disciple

06:11.040 --> 06:11.610
I found you.

06:13.680 --> 06:15.050
She's decent.

06:15.430 --> 06:16.730
Talented

06:17.800 --> 06:18.540
but

06:18.680 --> 06:19.540
easily distracted.

06:20.680 --> 06:21.290
It's fine.

06:21.600 --> 06:23.170
I can take my time to teach her.

06:27.240 --> 06:27.700
Senior Ma,

06:28.750 --> 06:29.410
will you

06:29.680 --> 06:30.610
be gone for a long time?

06:34.390 --> 06:36.370
We need to leave for a while.

06:36.680 --> 06:37.370
There's

06:37.830 --> 06:40.410
something wrong with our sect.

06:41.070 --> 06:41.810
I plan

06:42.040 --> 06:43.170
to go into hiding.

06:43.950 --> 06:44.660
How so?

06:46.390 --> 06:47.250
In the past two months,

06:47.750 --> 06:48.780
many people

06:49.310 --> 06:51.540
from Baiji Hall came

06:52.040 --> 06:53.370
and bought all kinds

06:53.800 --> 06:55.050
of herbs

06:56.000 --> 06:57.140
that were aged.

06:58.240 --> 07:00.140
It's not just the hundred-year spirit herb.

07:00.360 --> 07:01.580
Even the decade-old ones

07:01.720 --> 07:02.900
are gone.

07:03.720 --> 07:05.020
What is happening?

07:05.600 --> 07:07.250
Is the front line

07:07.600 --> 07:08.780
in a dire situation?

07:12.070 --> 07:13.250
I just returned from the Imperial Capital.

07:13.680 --> 07:14.780
I'm not up to date

07:15.360 --> 07:16.050
regarding the front line.

07:20.070 --> 07:22.610
I tended this garden for many years.

07:23.190 --> 07:24.570
Every plant here

07:24.600 --> 07:26.610
contains our hard work.

07:26.950 --> 07:29.170
I'd rather leave than watch them

07:29.390 --> 07:30.610
squeeze this land dry.

07:30.800 --> 07:32.220
Out of sight, out of mind.

07:32.390 --> 07:33.340
You are smart.

07:33.510 --> 07:34.410
This war

07:34.560 --> 07:35.410
seems pointless.

07:35.600 --> 07:36.930
It's always

07:37.190 --> 07:38.340
about land disputes

07:38.510 --> 07:39.220
or resource disputes.

07:39.600 --> 07:40.340
It's been going on for so long.

07:40.870 --> 07:41.980
Yet those cultivators in the Nascent Soul Stage

07:42.160 --> 07:43.340
do not care.

07:43.480 --> 07:45.370
And cultivators like us pay with our lives.

07:45.950 --> 07:47.220
Listen to me.

07:47.720 --> 07:48.980
If it becomes too much for you,

07:49.310 --> 07:50.730
find an exit strategy.

07:51.510 --> 07:52.050
Your life

07:52.190 --> 07:53.170
is always more important.

07:54.630 --> 07:55.850
Thank you for the advice,

07:56.360 --> 07:57.170
Senior Ma.

07:57.870 --> 07:58.460
I appreciate it.

07:59.720 --> 08:00.370
I'm

08:01.160 --> 08:02.170
old.

08:02.720 --> 08:03.850
I nag

08:04.310 --> 08:05.340
a lot.

08:05.480 --> 08:06.170
Han,

08:06.310 --> 08:07.290
you are a lucky man.

08:07.480 --> 08:08.730
Perhaps you don't need my advice.

08:09.040 --> 08:10.490
But I do not know when we'll meet again

08:10.870 --> 08:12.290
after this departure.

08:12.870 --> 08:14.140
I didn't let them

08:14.390 --> 08:15.050
have

08:15.240 --> 08:17.170
certain herbs.

08:17.800 --> 08:18.910
We put in

08:19.040 --> 08:19.900
a lot of effort

08:20.000 --> 08:22.020
to grow these herbs.

08:22.390 --> 08:23.020
You know what?

08:23.360 --> 08:24.290
If you have use for them,

08:24.680 --> 08:25.810
use them.

08:30.120 --> 08:31.100
Han.

08:31.390 --> 08:32.490
Take care.

08:36.040 --> 08:36.580
Remember.

08:37.070 --> 08:38.290
Don't die before me.

08:39.160 --> 08:40.580
I won't die so soon.

08:43.480 --> 08:43.980
Master.

08:44.950 --> 08:45.660
Come.

08:52.000 --> 08:52.660
Who knows

08:53.510 --> 08:55.370
if I'll see Mentor Ma again?

09:01.800 --> 09:02.850
Has the situation

09:03.750 --> 09:05.140
at the front line grown this dire?

09:07.000 --> 09:08.460
If the Seven Sects are defeated,

09:09.160 --> 09:09.810
will there still be

09:10.160 --> 09:10.930
a peaceful place

09:11.680 --> 09:12.490
for people

09:12.560 --> 09:14.290
to cultivate?

09:35.380 --> 09:38.340
♪That day I first saw you♪

09:38.860 --> 09:41.980
♪We held close, hearts full of joy♪

09:43.540 --> 09:46.700
♪We made a promise to reunite♪

09:47.740 --> 09:50.780
♪And walked into the unknown...♪

09:52.190 --> 09:53.290
He always has an issue.

09:54.120 --> 09:54.700
Huayuan,

09:55.270 --> 09:56.540
I've been having a bad feeling.

09:56.800 --> 09:58.410
Something bad is about to happen.

09:59.750 --> 10:00.610
Don't worry, Hongfu.

10:01.190 --> 10:02.250
The Seven Sects are going

10:02.750 --> 10:03.580
all out.

10:04.170 --> 10:05.290
I estimate

10:05.340 --> 10:06.420
a 50% chance of winning, at least.

10:07.240 --> 10:07.580
You know what?

10:08.380 --> 10:09.530
Why don't you observe from the side?

10:09.840 --> 10:10.580
My disciples and I

10:10.790 --> 10:11.940
will attack them first.

10:13.270 --> 10:13.580
Let's go.

10:13.750 --> 10:14.490
Yes.

10:17.380 --> 10:21.020
♪To be one standing tall and proud♪

10:21.620 --> 10:25.140
♪Never become a hollow shell♪

10:26.020 --> 10:29.340
♪The ones before once told me♪

10:29.780 --> 10:33.340
♪There's still hardship ahead♪

10:33.940 --> 10:37.460
♪Even as cold winds blow...♪

10:37.510 --> 10:38.250
Master.

10:39.750 --> 10:40.610
Song Meng, Weiniang.

10:42.360 --> 10:43.650
You are the only ones left.

10:45.780 --> 10:49.460
♪Time slipped by before we knew♪

10:49.820 --> 10:53.460
♪Yet we burn that spark of light...♪

10:55.840 --> 10:57.850
My fellow disciples of Yellow Maple Valley!

10:58.910 --> 10:59.700
Yes, Master!

11:00.150 --> 11:01.010
Yes, Master!

11:01.670 --> 11:02.610
Yes, Master!

11:02.620 --> 11:05.820
♪While the mayfly dies in the whirlpool♪

11:06.460 --> 11:09.900
♪Fate raises a toast with song♪

11:10.540 --> 11:14.060
♪Playing the fleeting game of life...♪

11:14.390 --> 11:15.370
Lead the war with me.

11:16.960 --> 11:17.490
Yes, Master!

11:18.360 --> 11:19.220
Yes, Master!

11:19.220 --> 11:22.420
♪Who can guess the ending...♪

11:22.550 --> 11:23.130
Charge!

11:23.140 --> 11:26.460
♪But my heart has never rested♪

11:27.140 --> 11:30.500
♪Ever chasing, still searching on♪

11:31.140 --> 11:34.700
♪Through all the joy and sorrow♪

11:35.300 --> 11:38.780
♪How do I choose the way?♪

11:44.630 --> 11:46.370
It's time to get ready for the war.

11:47.270 --> 11:48.060
If I leave,

11:48.840 --> 11:50.340
who knows when I can come back again?

11:51.200 --> 11:52.180
Alas, I can't bring

11:52.390 --> 11:53.610
this cavern and the spirit spring with me.

11:56.270 --> 11:57.890
These are all the herbs required for the Core Formation Stage.

11:58.510 --> 11:59.700
I planted them painstakingly.

12:00.270 --> 12:01.250
None can go to waste.

13:05.840 --> 13:07.100
81 tolls of the Dragonfell Bell?

13:08.200 --> 13:08.940
Our sect has fallen.

13:10.790 --> 13:11.460
Did something

13:12.720 --> 13:13.530
happen at the front line?

13:17.720 --> 13:19.300
81 tolls of Dragonfell Bell.

13:20.600 --> 13:22.610
I suppose you know what this means.

13:24.150 --> 13:24.730
That's right.

13:26.750 --> 13:27.940
Several hours ago,

13:29.080 --> 13:30.700
Spirit Beast Mountain and Skyfort Castle

13:30.960 --> 13:32.100
turned against us.

13:32.910 --> 13:33.980
The alliance collapsed.

13:34.870 --> 13:35.770
More than half

13:36.670 --> 13:37.820
of the Foundation Establishment cultivators are gone.

13:39.840 --> 13:40.630
What in the world?

13:40.720 --> 13:41.460
Yellow Maple Valley...

13:41.490 --> 13:42.940
- What do we do? - ...has been defeated...

13:42.940 --> 13:43.510
Defeated?

13:43.670 --> 13:44.220
...in this war.

13:45.320 --> 13:46.300
The demonic sects

13:46.870 --> 13:47.850
continue to advance.

13:49.360 --> 13:50.490
They will break through

13:50.630 --> 13:52.010
the last line of defense soon.

13:52.390 --> 13:53.460
The last line of defense?

13:53.550 --> 13:54.650
Spirit Beast Mountain and Skyfort Castle...

13:54.660 --> 13:56.100
- How could this be? - ...turned against us?

13:56.440 --> 13:56.980
They defected?

13:57.150 --> 13:57.940
They are scoundrels!

13:58.390 --> 13:59.650
What happened to Master and the rest?

13:59.790 --> 14:00.730
We're done for!

14:00.840 --> 14:02.050
- We're done for! - Silence!

14:02.050 --> 14:02.890
We're done for!

14:03.180 --> 14:03.980
Those despicable scums.

14:04.000 --> 14:04.750
We're done for!

14:04.790 --> 14:05.730
- But I did warn them. - Silence!

14:06.140 --> 14:07.460
But he never believed me.

14:08.320 --> 14:08.890
Silence.

14:09.910 --> 14:10.580
We're done for.

14:10.600 --> 14:11.130
Silence!

14:15.600 --> 14:16.610
Listen to me.

14:17.320 --> 14:19.220
While our existence is indeed in a crisis,

14:20.000 --> 14:21.850
it is not the moment to give up hope.

14:22.870 --> 14:25.250
Although the Core Formation Stage elders are not here,

14:25.840 --> 14:27.010
we can beseech

14:27.240 --> 14:28.820
Grand Elder to intervene.

14:34.480 --> 14:35.770
Please help us turn the tide,

14:36.390 --> 14:37.460
Grandmaster!

14:38.790 --> 14:41.130
Please help us turn the tide,

14:41.320 --> 14:42.890
Grand Elder!

14:43.440 --> 14:45.580
Please help us turn the tide,

14:45.790 --> 14:47.100
Grand Elder!

14:47.840 --> 14:49.820
Please help us turn the tide,

14:50.030 --> 14:51.340
Grand Elder!

14:51.910 --> 14:53.770
Please help us turn the tide,

14:54.080 --> 14:55.250
Grand Elder!

14:55.870 --> 14:57.700
Please help us turn the tide,

14:57.960 --> 14:59.100
Grand Elder!

14:59.120 --> 14:59.700
This is futile.

15:00.630 --> 15:01.890
If those Nascent Soul elders were willing to intervene,

15:02.120 --> 15:03.370
the war would have ended already.

15:03.960 --> 15:05.300
Why intervene now then?

15:06.600 --> 15:07.370
In this time of need,

15:08.000 --> 15:09.300
relying on yourself is better

15:09.720 --> 15:11.370
than relying on others.

15:11.840 --> 15:13.700
Please help us turn the tide,

15:13.960 --> 15:15.180
Grand Elder!

15:15.390 --> 15:17.300
Please help us turn the tide,

15:17.510 --> 15:18.890
Grand Elder!

15:19.150 --> 15:21.100
Please help us turn the tide,

15:21.320 --> 15:22.770
Grand Elder!

15:29.670 --> 15:30.300
What is going on?

15:31.720 --> 15:32.850
Did you ever study

15:33.030 --> 15:35.250
some kind of soul technique?

15:37.030 --> 15:37.770
Grandmaster,

15:38.360 --> 15:38.820
I did

15:39.120 --> 15:41.220
study one particular soul technique.

15:44.300 --> 15:46.270
[Grandmaster Linghu]

15:46.270 --> 15:47.650
Interesting.

15:48.150 --> 15:49.130
Your foundation is solid.

15:49.720 --> 15:50.820
You have the right mindset too.

15:51.480 --> 15:52.420
Unfortunately,

15:52.790 --> 15:54.340
your spirit root

15:55.080 --> 15:55.770
is too weak.

15:56.870 --> 15:58.130
So this is the power of a Nascent Soul Stage cultivator?

15:59.000 --> 16:00.340
If I hadn't studied Great Deployment Art

16:00.440 --> 16:01.300
to reinforce my soul,

16:01.840 --> 16:03.420
I wouldn't even have been able to reply to him.

16:08.910 --> 16:11.650
I hate to see people on their knees.

16:14.550 --> 16:15.820
Everyone, get up now.

16:20.080 --> 16:22.180
Please help us turn the tide,

16:22.320 --> 16:23.980
Grand Elder!

16:25.200 --> 16:26.490
Didn't I say

16:26.750 --> 16:28.780
that I hated to see people on their knees?

16:28.780 --> 16:30.250
Get up now!

16:34.320 --> 16:35.770
Did you think

16:35.910 --> 16:37.180
that I'll say yes

16:37.720 --> 16:39.460
if you kneel?

16:43.150 --> 16:44.490
As cultivators,

16:46.000 --> 16:47.580
how could you forget

16:47.600 --> 16:49.060
about the importance of easement?

16:52.480 --> 16:53.770
As you can already see,

16:54.240 --> 16:55.820
our sect

16:56.960 --> 16:58.490
is probably no more.

16:59.080 --> 17:00.460
So disperse now.

17:01.510 --> 17:04.060
Don't bother me and my cultivation.

17:06.550 --> 17:07.010
Grandmaster,

17:07.900 --> 17:08.760
forgive our incompetence.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.220
We deserve to be punished.

17:10.720 --> 17:12.300
But our sect has centuries of legacy.

17:12.320 --> 17:13.730
It can't go down now.

17:13.960 --> 17:15.220
Please have mercy

17:15.750 --> 17:16.610
and kill those demonic sects.

17:17.270 --> 17:18.700
Save us from the impending doom!

17:20.960 --> 17:21.610
Sect Master!

17:21.630 --> 17:23.890
- You idiot. - Sect Master!

17:27.510 --> 17:28.940
What makes you think

17:29.960 --> 17:30.610
that I'll

17:30.670 --> 17:32.010
risk my life for useless beings

17:32.080 --> 17:33.770
like all of you here?

17:34.000 --> 17:35.980
All I want is peace.

17:36.960 --> 17:38.700
All of you are weak

17:38.910 --> 17:39.890
yet you want me

17:40.080 --> 17:42.530
to fight those powerful monsters for you.

17:44.360 --> 17:46.060
I can do that.

17:46.390 --> 17:47.100
But I...

17:47.630 --> 17:49.060
I'm not strong enough.

17:50.120 --> 17:51.490
A battle between

17:52.440 --> 17:54.180
Nascent Soul Stage cultivators will be a grueling one.

17:54.790 --> 17:56.420
People will die.

17:56.510 --> 17:58.010
Die!

17:59.840 --> 18:00.890
Grandmaster.

18:02.720 --> 18:03.820
Grandmaster!

18:04.240 --> 18:05.340
You want me

18:07.030 --> 18:07.820
to die

18:08.270 --> 18:09.850
for you?

18:11.240 --> 18:12.220
Why? Because you

18:12.510 --> 18:13.250
performed

18:13.440 --> 18:14.850
a kowtow

18:14.960 --> 18:16.820
and called me a grand elder?

18:20.030 --> 18:21.010
How absurd!

18:21.390 --> 18:22.580
Absurd!

18:27.220 --> 18:28.730
- We're all alone. - Grandmaster left us.

18:28.790 --> 18:29.370
What do we do?

18:29.840 --> 18:30.460
He left us.

18:30.480 --> 18:31.130
What do we do?

18:31.840 --> 18:32.460
What do we do?

18:32.750 --> 18:33.420
What do we do?

18:33.840 --> 18:34.770
It's over for our sect.

18:34.870 --> 18:35.700
What do we do?

18:35.870 --> 18:36.340
Grandmaster.

18:39.080 --> 18:40.140
Those Nascent Soul Stage cultivators

18:40.640 --> 18:41.770
stay out of the war

18:42.270 --> 18:44.010
and leave weak disciples to die.

18:44.590 --> 18:45.490
How dare they?

18:46.480 --> 18:47.250
What do we do?

18:49.550 --> 18:50.810
Sect Master.

18:51.000 --> 18:51.460
Sect Master.

18:51.510 --> 18:53.250
Grandmaster does not care about us.

18:53.440 --> 18:54.420
What do we do?

18:54.920 --> 18:55.420
Everyone.

18:57.200 --> 18:58.180
Do not panic.

19:01.680 --> 19:02.980
We still have the Mountain Barrier.

19:04.790 --> 19:06.220
If we work together,

19:06.880 --> 19:07.940
we can defend this place.

19:08.350 --> 19:09.290
I swear

19:09.790 --> 19:10.940
to live and die

19:11.310 --> 19:12.140
with this place.

19:13.240 --> 19:14.180
He's right.

19:14.510 --> 19:15.620
We have the Mountain Barrier.

19:15.830 --> 19:16.570
We fear nothing.

19:16.750 --> 19:17.330
We live or die with this sect!

19:17.400 --> 19:18.460
At this juncture,

19:18.830 --> 19:20.250
speeches that raise morale

19:20.590 --> 19:21.730
serve no purpose.

19:22.070 --> 19:23.140
I must find a way

19:23.590 --> 19:25.220
to deal with the upcoming invasion.

19:26.070 --> 19:27.190
Look at those fools.

19:29.400 --> 19:30.490
If you hear this message

19:30.790 --> 19:31.770
and want to live,

19:32.000 --> 19:33.140
come to Qianji Hall

19:33.440 --> 19:34.860
after 15 minutes.

19:35.200 --> 19:36.490
Do not be late.

19:43.680 --> 19:44.900
Am I chosen?

19:45.790 --> 19:46.530
Is there

19:46.750 --> 19:47.900
another plan?

20:04.160 --> 20:04.660
Weiniang.

20:05.240 --> 20:05.700
Are you all right?

20:05.880 --> 20:06.490
I'm fine.

20:11.110 --> 20:13.050
Oh, the infamous Hongfen

20:13.510 --> 20:14.180
and Skull.

20:15.110 --> 20:17.090
You are knowledgeable.

20:24.160 --> 20:24.900
Elder Han,

20:25.720 --> 20:26.700
you betrayed the Seven Sects

20:27.270 --> 20:28.220
and turned on us.

20:28.550 --> 20:29.700
You have killed many people.

20:30.640 --> 20:31.660
My gullible juniors,

20:32.160 --> 20:34.010
since your master and I are good friends,

20:34.070 --> 20:35.660
I'll give you a second chance.

20:36.030 --> 20:37.420
Join us now.

20:40.720 --> 20:41.290
Elder Han,

20:42.270 --> 20:43.810
while I may be weak,

20:44.590 --> 20:46.290
I am not

20:47.030 --> 20:48.090
a traitor.

20:53.830 --> 20:55.420
I am Song Meng of Qingbo Cavern, Yellow Maple Valley,

20:56.200 --> 20:58.010
the fourth disciple of Li Huayuan.

20:59.070 --> 21:00.140
Take my life if you can.

21:06.030 --> 21:06.660
Song Meng.

21:06.920 --> 21:07.530
Song Meng.

21:08.550 --> 21:09.180
Song Meng.

21:10.160 --> 21:10.940
Song Meng.

21:11.440 --> 21:12.090
Song Meng.

21:14.720 --> 21:15.330
Song Meng.

21:17.720 --> 21:18.290
Weiniang.

21:19.030 --> 21:20.010
Why are you still here?

21:21.200 --> 21:22.330
Jing is gone.

21:22.790 --> 21:23.730
If you're gone too,

21:23.920 --> 21:25.380
there's no reason for me to live in this world.

21:27.880 --> 21:29.010
Darling,

21:29.200 --> 21:31.290
I love to see this kind of story.

21:31.510 --> 21:33.730
Those Seven Sects are weak.

21:34.240 --> 21:35.810
But seeing these star-crossed lovers

21:36.070 --> 21:37.530
navigating through the turmoil of war

21:37.790 --> 21:39.700
can be so addictive.

21:39.880 --> 21:41.380
I'm glad you like it.

21:41.830 --> 21:42.640
But

21:42.750 --> 21:44.500
our priority targets still roam.

21:44.750 --> 21:46.220
We cannot dally.

21:46.830 --> 21:48.940
Let's end them now.

21:52.070 --> 21:53.700
I am Zhong Weiniang

21:54.310 --> 21:56.380
of Qingbo Cavern, Yellow Maple Valley,

21:56.790 --> 21:57.940
the seventh disciple of Li Huayuan.

21:58.310 --> 21:59.900
Take my life if you can.

22:08.200 --> 22:09.730
Insolence.

22:10.960 --> 22:12.660
I shall grant you your wish

22:12.880 --> 22:14.290
and take your life.

22:25.160 --> 22:27.490
Don't bully them now.

22:31.110 --> 22:32.010
I made it in time.

22:42.110 --> 22:42.730
Zhong.

22:42.960 --> 22:43.570
Song.

22:43.880 --> 22:44.530
Your job is done.

22:44.830 --> 22:45.620
Go back and rest up.

22:46.240 --> 22:46.570
Oh.

22:46.960 --> 22:48.220
Tell your master

22:48.510 --> 22:49.700
that he owes me one.

22:50.110 --> 22:50.620
Farewell.

22:57.830 --> 22:59.420
Han and the perverted couple there,

22:59.550 --> 23:00.460
the three of you

23:01.030 --> 23:03.330
ganged up on those two disciples.

23:03.720 --> 23:04.730
Have you no shame?

23:06.480 --> 23:07.250
Fu Yunzi.

23:08.110 --> 23:09.940
Your legs are trembling.

23:10.310 --> 23:12.330
You look like you're dying.

23:12.830 --> 23:13.860
One small mistake

23:14.030 --> 23:15.660
and you might lose your life here.

23:16.110 --> 23:16.770
Why don't you

23:17.000 --> 23:19.490
join me to do great things together?

23:20.400 --> 23:21.770
In your dreams.

23:22.790 --> 23:23.980
Darling.

23:24.310 --> 23:26.570
I don't like that old guy.

23:26.830 --> 23:28.730
He ruined my show.

23:29.110 --> 23:30.620
Kill him for me.

23:30.750 --> 23:31.700
Kill him.

23:32.790 --> 23:33.860
Fu Yunzi,

23:34.550 --> 23:36.140
you made my wife angry.

23:36.790 --> 23:37.900
You'll have

23:38.270 --> 23:39.620
to pay the price today.

23:43.880 --> 23:45.290
My friends,

23:45.830 --> 23:47.140
let's see

23:49.110 --> 23:50.900
if you have the ability

23:52.030 --> 23:53.980
to kill me or not.

24:03.510 --> 24:05.050
Go away!

24:36.790 --> 24:37.940
You have quick reflexes.

24:39.510 --> 24:40.050
Master.

24:42.160 --> 24:44.220
It's been a while. Did you ascend again?

24:45.350 --> 24:46.530
Thanks to your teachings.

24:47.720 --> 24:48.250
Master,

24:49.310 --> 24:50.010
are you all right?

24:50.200 --> 24:51.090
I'm fine.

24:52.000 --> 24:52.770
Were you hoping

24:53.110 --> 24:54.220
for something to happen to me?

24:54.830 --> 24:55.490
Of course, not.

24:56.000 --> 24:56.620
I know...

24:56.790 --> 24:58.090
- Mentor Li. - ...you are strong.

24:58.270 --> 24:59.220
You will surely be safe.

24:59.440 --> 24:59.900
Mentor Li.

25:01.310 --> 25:01.900
Master.

25:02.480 --> 25:02.900
Mentor Li.

25:03.590 --> 25:05.220
Regarding the battle with the Black Fiend Cult,

25:05.720 --> 25:06.460
I'm sorry.

25:07.310 --> 25:09.530
Senior Wu and Senior Liu died because of me.

25:10.200 --> 25:11.250
Please punish me.

25:12.010 --> 25:12.940
- Mentor Li. - It's fine.

25:14.830 --> 25:16.180
Song Meng and Weiniang

25:16.310 --> 25:18.330
already told me everything.

25:19.440 --> 25:22.140
Who would have thought that the cultists

25:22.310 --> 25:24.090
had infiltrated the royalty this deeply?

25:25.640 --> 25:27.570
And now that the demonic sects are invading,

25:27.640 --> 25:29.530
we are indeed having trouble at two fronts.

25:31.030 --> 25:31.810
Fortunately,

25:32.960 --> 25:34.010
you returned here safely.

25:34.110 --> 25:35.700
I am glad.

25:38.350 --> 25:38.810
Oh,

25:39.480 --> 25:41.220
I heard Senior Song and Senior Zhong

25:41.590 --> 25:42.420
went to the front line.

25:42.640 --> 25:43.010
Yes, they did.

25:43.640 --> 25:44.490
Where are they now?

25:48.720 --> 25:49.530
We split up.

25:50.310 --> 25:51.810
I thought they would return.

25:52.550 --> 25:53.860
But I guess

25:54.550 --> 25:55.860
things aren't doing that well for them.

26:02.310 --> 26:02.980
Mentor Li.

26:07.830 --> 26:08.380
Mentor Li.

26:09.680 --> 26:10.460
Han Li,

26:10.920 --> 26:11.660
listen carefully.

26:12.400 --> 26:14.330
The meeting later is crucial.

26:15.270 --> 26:16.860
I begged for a while

26:17.000 --> 26:18.860
to reserve a spot for you.

26:19.480 --> 26:20.770
Don't squander it.

26:34.270 --> 26:34.980
What do we do?

26:36.240 --> 26:37.330
What do we do?

26:39.880 --> 26:40.420
It's over.

26:47.350 --> 26:49.140
They are all at least Mid Foundation Establishment.

26:50.480 --> 26:51.090
It seems like

26:51.590 --> 26:52.730
all of the capable fighters

26:52.880 --> 26:53.730
are gathered here.

26:58.640 --> 26:59.250
Grandmaster.

27:01.920 --> 27:03.140
Grandmaster.

27:09.270 --> 27:10.940
Grandmaster Linghu.

27:15.750 --> 27:16.250
Grandmaster.

27:24.960 --> 27:26.330
Good.

27:27.270 --> 27:28.250
You're all here.

27:29.640 --> 27:30.700
Then,

27:31.070 --> 27:32.140
I

27:33.030 --> 27:34.860
have no need to beat around the bush.

27:35.590 --> 27:36.730
As you all

27:36.920 --> 27:37.660
already know,

27:38.110 --> 27:39.250
the front line

27:40.000 --> 27:41.570
has crumbled.

27:42.110 --> 27:44.050
The demonic sects

27:44.070 --> 27:46.140
are heading toward us.

27:46.720 --> 27:47.900
They say

27:48.270 --> 27:49.660
to kill all

27:51.030 --> 27:52.220
who resist.

27:54.400 --> 27:55.380
I fear

27:56.440 --> 27:57.900
all hope is lost.

28:02.270 --> 28:03.290
Grandmaster,

28:03.750 --> 28:05.980
don't frighten the younglings.

28:09.920 --> 28:10.940
My fellow disciples,

28:11.880 --> 28:13.730
you play key roles in our sect.

28:14.310 --> 28:15.460
The legacy of Yellow Maple Valley

28:15.480 --> 28:17.140
falls on your shoulders.

28:17.350 --> 28:17.940
The act

28:18.310 --> 28:19.490
Grandmaster put up earlier

28:19.720 --> 28:20.730
before the hall

28:21.160 --> 28:22.290
was to make those cowards

28:22.310 --> 28:24.570
escape as soon as possible.

28:25.160 --> 28:27.530
That way, our evacuation plan will proceed smoothly.

28:30.750 --> 28:31.570
I see. Forgive us.

28:32.160 --> 28:32.940
Where do we

28:33.030 --> 28:33.460
go

28:33.680 --> 28:34.490
from here?

28:34.790 --> 28:35.900
Please instruct us.

28:37.510 --> 28:39.010
I'll answer that on behalf of him.

28:42.000 --> 28:42.810
Grand Elder

28:43.070 --> 28:44.530
had previously contacted our allies

28:44.550 --> 28:45.730
in the Nine Kingdoms Alliance.

28:46.350 --> 28:47.460
They promised

28:47.720 --> 28:48.770
to provide refuge.

28:49.480 --> 28:50.460
And now,

28:51.000 --> 28:52.570
Mentor Li and I

28:52.590 --> 28:53.460
will evacuate

28:54.030 --> 28:55.050
all of you in batches.

28:56.550 --> 28:57.460
Oh, the Nine Kingdoms Alliance.

28:57.640 --> 28:58.180
Wonderful.

28:58.310 --> 28:59.010
It's one of the

28:59.110 --> 29:00.050
strongest factions in Tiannan.

29:00.270 --> 29:00.620
We

29:00.750 --> 29:01.900
are all saved!

29:02.030 --> 29:03.530
There's nothing such as a free favor.

29:04.200 --> 29:04.980
We seek refuge.

29:05.270 --> 29:06.180
We have to do

29:06.920 --> 29:08.250
their bidding.

29:10.440 --> 29:11.620
- We're saved. - The Nine Kingdoms Alliance.

29:36.440 --> 29:38.050
Soul-Burning Spell.

29:38.480 --> 29:40.940
I believe you know what it does.

29:43.680 --> 29:44.810
I also added

29:46.110 --> 29:48.770
a telepathic spell.

29:49.720 --> 29:50.770
You may use

29:51.640 --> 29:52.460
your energy

29:53.030 --> 29:54.570
to communicate

29:55.400 --> 29:57.490
within a radius of 100 li.

29:59.310 --> 30:01.090
So long as the light still shines,

30:01.400 --> 30:02.050
I will know

30:02.240 --> 30:04.220
where you are!

30:08.070 --> 30:10.010
Do note that this journey as refugees

30:10.790 --> 30:12.730
will not be as peaceful as the life you have here.

30:15.110 --> 30:16.010
All of you,

30:16.440 --> 30:18.250
be cautious.

30:22.640 --> 30:24.290
Thank you for your help, Grandmaster.

30:24.550 --> 30:26.700
We will help each other

30:26.960 --> 30:28.940
and not bring shame to our sect.

30:32.350 --> 30:34.570
You bootlickers.

30:35.240 --> 30:36.140
You are refugees now.

30:36.240 --> 30:36.570
Quit...

30:36.880 --> 30:38.660
Quit worrying about shame and reputation.

30:41.440 --> 30:41.810
Now,

30:42.550 --> 30:43.980
why are you standing there?

30:44.590 --> 30:45.420
Waiting for food?

30:46.830 --> 30:48.290
Get ready now.

30:48.720 --> 30:49.770
We regroup

30:50.110 --> 30:52.050
at the great hall later.

30:52.960 --> 30:53.860
Yes!

30:56.790 --> 30:58.250
Don't tell anyone.

30:58.790 --> 30:59.770
Yes.

31:02.830 --> 31:03.380
Hurry up.

31:03.550 --> 31:05.180
- Yes. - Yes.

31:15.790 --> 31:16.290
Master.

31:17.590 --> 31:18.290
Go.

31:22.350 --> 31:23.620
I don't want to leave,

31:24.510 --> 31:25.700
but I can't stay here and face my fate either.

31:26.640 --> 31:27.730
I should just get ready

31:28.200 --> 31:29.220
for all eventualities.

31:55.000 --> 31:55.810
This

31:55.880 --> 31:57.290
isn't the place, it seems.

31:58.440 --> 32:00.140
I need another place.

32:01.270 --> 32:02.010
Truth be told,

32:02.270 --> 32:04.490
I quite like the maple trees here.

32:34.920 --> 32:35.620
Young Master,

32:36.440 --> 32:38.700
we have now arrived at Yellow Maple Valley.

32:43.350 --> 32:45.180
What is wrong with him this time?

32:52.720 --> 32:54.460
I feel bad for the Seven Sects.

32:54.880 --> 32:56.730
The Moonshadow Sect has shut its door to everyone.

32:56.920 --> 32:58.290
The Clear Void Sect is almost annihilated.

32:58.590 --> 32:59.660
Only three other sects

32:59.750 --> 33:01.010
are still putting up resistance.

33:01.400 --> 33:02.490
Success is not far from you,

33:02.590 --> 33:03.570
Young Master.

33:10.590 --> 33:12.530
I know what's bothering you, Young Master.

33:13.240 --> 33:14.570
It's a person.

33:15.310 --> 33:16.140
Li

33:16.350 --> 33:17.810
Feiyu.

33:20.270 --> 33:21.570
It's not Li Feiyu.

33:22.880 --> 33:23.980
It's Han Li.

33:24.720 --> 33:25.490
What?

33:32.460 --> 33:35.140
[Han Li]

33:35.960 --> 33:36.980
Han Li?

33:38.350 --> 33:40.570
List of Yellow Maple Valley Disciples.

33:41.000 --> 33:41.770
This is a treasure.

33:41.830 --> 33:42.860
Where did you get it from?

33:43.510 --> 33:45.330
Someone gave it to me.

33:48.640 --> 33:50.380
His name is Han Li?

33:52.510 --> 33:54.250
So I've been fooled by him

33:54.350 --> 33:56.090
all this time.

33:58.480 --> 33:59.570
Tell them

34:00.590 --> 34:02.050
to invade Yellow Maple Valley.

34:02.430 --> 34:03.970
Whoever captures Han Li alive

34:05.920 --> 34:06.860
will be rewarded.

34:10.750 --> 34:11.770
Invade Yellow Maple Valley.

34:12.510 --> 34:13.810
Capture Han Li alive.

35:05.160 --> 35:06.050
I don't want to leave either.

35:06.920 --> 35:08.290
But now is not the moment to be sentimental.

35:12.160 --> 35:13.050
The demonic sects

35:13.200 --> 35:14.860
will arrive soon.

35:15.270 --> 35:17.050
Please group up now.

35:19.960 --> 35:21.010
It's a great cavern.

35:21.750 --> 35:22.570
I can't let others have it.

35:45.960 --> 35:46.740
Who knows

35:48.150 --> 35:49.570
when I'll return to this place again?

35:58.070 --> 35:59.170
It will be a dangerous journey.

36:00.280 --> 36:01.650
I can't bring you with me.

36:02.280 --> 36:03.260
Let's bid farewell here.

36:08.670 --> 36:09.090
All right.

36:09.110 --> 36:09.650
Don't do this.

36:15.760 --> 36:16.780
If fate permits,

36:18.030 --> 36:19.210
we'll meet in Yellow Maple Valley.

37:52.670 --> 37:53.340
Greetings, Mentor Hongfu.

37:58.550 --> 37:59.340
He is my attendant.

37:59.710 --> 38:00.380
He is strong too.

38:00.880 --> 38:01.690
He won't be a dead weight.

38:05.440 --> 38:06.650
Have you packed everything?

38:07.030 --> 38:07.980
After we leave,

38:08.480 --> 38:10.090
we won't come back for the foreseeable future.

38:11.670 --> 38:12.740
I appreciate your concern, Mentor Hongfu.

38:13.320 --> 38:14.090
I've packed everything.

38:19.510 --> 38:20.300
Where's Master?

38:20.840 --> 38:21.740
He won't come with us?

38:23.710 --> 38:24.860
Your master and Sect Master will evacuate

38:24.920 --> 38:26.690
another batch of disciples alongside Sect Master Zhong later.

38:27.440 --> 38:27.900
Otherwise,

38:28.110 --> 38:28.980
a bigger party

38:29.360 --> 38:30.380
might draw attention.

38:58.550 --> 39:00.130
Mentor Hongfu.

39:03.400 --> 39:04.460
Listen up.

39:06.030 --> 39:07.090
It will be a dangerous trip.

39:07.630 --> 39:09.420
We have to cut across the demonic sects' territory.

39:10.760 --> 39:12.940
If we come across enemies, do not fight for too long.

39:13.800 --> 39:14.570
Once you flee,

39:14.800 --> 39:16.260
locate us with the Soul-Burning Spell

39:16.800 --> 39:18.460
and regroup at the marked place.

39:19.400 --> 39:20.170
Yes!

39:22.360 --> 39:22.900
Let's go.

41:31.710 --> 41:32.340
Han Li.

41:39.230 --> 41:39.860
Mentor Hongfu.

41:42.550 --> 41:44.210
You must be disappointed in us.

41:45.280 --> 41:46.780
Your master and I are here,

41:47.070 --> 41:48.900
yet we can't save ourselves from the defeat.

41:50.440 --> 41:51.050
Mentor Hongfu,

41:52.110 --> 41:53.130
in fact,

41:53.550 --> 41:54.340
I came across

41:54.400 --> 41:55.820
Spirit Beast Mountain's plan to betray us in advance.

41:56.280 --> 41:57.300
I informed Sect Master Zhong

41:57.920 --> 41:58.820
and even sent

41:58.920 --> 41:59.980
a missive to warn Master.

42:02.110 --> 42:03.210
Oh?

42:04.920 --> 42:05.860
Yet your master and I

42:06.070 --> 42:07.420
never received the missive

42:08.230 --> 42:09.860
in our operation together.

42:11.480 --> 42:12.170
No wonder.

42:14.710 --> 42:15.650
Alas,

42:16.000 --> 42:16.900
there's no point

42:17.630 --> 42:18.820
in dwelling in the past anymore.

42:22.110 --> 42:23.260
You let go easily

42:23.400 --> 42:24.090
and are level-headed.

42:25.000 --> 42:26.130
You stand out from the rest,

42:26.480 --> 42:27.460
and I see why

42:27.510 --> 42:29.010
your master paid you extra attention.

42:30.840 --> 42:32.050
Even Grandmaster Linghu

42:32.190 --> 42:33.210
asked me to specifically

42:33.710 --> 42:35.170
bring you with us.

42:35.550 --> 42:37.300
I think he likes you.

42:39.320 --> 42:40.420
You flatter me.

42:40.590 --> 42:42.260
I can't believe I have earned his favor.

42:43.400 --> 42:45.300
Xuan'er isn't as fortunate as you.

42:46.070 --> 42:46.980
And now,

42:47.590 --> 42:48.900
I regret what I did very much.

42:59.070 --> 42:59.690
Mentor Hongfu,

43:00.590 --> 43:01.300
the frontline

43:01.510 --> 43:02.610
has perhaps fallen to the demonic sects.

43:03.320 --> 43:04.490
If they are there,

43:04.800 --> 43:05.420
what is our plan?

43:23.070 --> 43:24.940
This is called the Mist of Camouflage.

43:25.480 --> 43:26.570
It'll help us.

43:46.710 --> 43:47.340
Wait.

43:49.320 --> 43:49.820
Mentor Li.

43:49.960 --> 43:50.530
At ease.

43:51.000 --> 43:52.420
Have you seen Mentor Hongfu?

43:53.000 --> 43:53.340
She...

43:54.480 --> 43:56.380
Did you not receive the message from Grandmaster Linghu?

43:56.760 --> 43:57.820
He asked Mentor Hongfu

43:57.920 --> 43:58.900
to evacuate some disciples first.

43:59.320 --> 43:59.820
We

43:59.920 --> 44:00.780
will follow suit soon.

44:03.510 --> 44:04.090
What's wrong?

44:08.440 --> 44:09.940
Did he give that order?

44:10.030 --> 44:10.610
Yes.

44:11.360 --> 44:12.170
What's the matter?

44:16.000 --> 44:17.130
I need to verify one thing.

44:17.550 --> 44:18.610
Leave without me.

44:48.110 --> 44:48.780
What a coincidence.

44:49.480 --> 44:50.460
I passed by here again.

45:05.280 --> 45:06.260
Careful.

45:06.440 --> 45:07.690
Something feels wrong about this place.

45:29.940 --> 45:35.260
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

45:36.500 --> 45:41.900
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

45:42.020 --> 45:45.220
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

45:45.460 --> 45:47.700
♪Old scenes rise again♪

45:48.100 --> 45:50.940
♪Too hard to forget♪

45:51.460 --> 45:55.420
♪Easier just to miss♪

45:56.260 --> 46:01.740
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

46:02.900 --> 46:08.180
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

46:08.780 --> 46:11.820
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

46:12.100 --> 46:14.220
♪Swept away by time♪

46:14.860 --> 46:17.500
♪Eyes once looked far♪

46:17.980 --> 46:21.940
♪Now lost in the shift♪

46:22.420 --> 46:25.260
♪Autumn winds stir♪

46:25.540 --> 46:27.460
♪Smoke curls once more♪

46:27.900 --> 46:30.340
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

46:30.660 --> 46:34.180
♪Returning to my eyes♪

46:34.740 --> 46:37.700
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

46:38.020 --> 46:40.940
♪Time lost its name♪

46:41.340 --> 46:44.180
♪Was it yesterday♪

46:44.580 --> 46:48.140
♪Or tomorrow?♪

46:48.500 --> 46:51.340
♪The world has changed♪

46:51.740 --> 46:53.580
♪Beyond recall♪

46:54.140 --> 46:55.860
♪Time will fade♪

46:56.260 --> 47:01.060
♪All the words ever spoken♪

47:01.740 --> 47:04.620
♪Only this longing remains♪

47:05.100 --> 47:10.380
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

47:11.500 --> 47:18.140
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

47:18.620 --> 47:28.340
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
